# GitHub Linguist Overrides
# Mark frontend embedded assets as vendored/generated so repository language is detected as Go
web/** linguist-vendored
web/** linguist-generated
*.min.css linguist-vendored
*.min.js linguist-vendored
web/index.html linguist-detectable=false
web/style.min.css linguist-detectable=false
web/lucide.min.js linguist-detectable=false
